18.text:
PRIVATE REFLECTION: The binding constraint is the White D1–D2 two-stone group. On a 4×5 board D1–D2 has the single outside liberty D3, so 1…B D3 captures D1–D2 at once. Any winning line must therefore begin 1.W D3. After 1.W D3 the White mass W = C3 C4 D1 D2 D3 has the two liberties D4, C5 and the three Black masses are A2 {A1 A3 B2}, B3–B4 {A3 A4 B2}, C1–C2 {B1 B2} with B2 the unique common liberty.

With the forced 1.W D3 Black’s natural and sufficient defence is 2.B B2. It unites A2 B2 B3 B4 C1 C2 into G with L(G)=A1 A3 A4 B1, four distinct liberties. Every frontal White probe is then a mutual atari / snap-back:

* 3.W B1 → White B1 has only A1, 4.B A1 captures W B1 and restores B1 as a fresh liberty to G;
* 3.W A3 → White A3 has only A4, 4.B A4 captures W A3 and restores A3 to G;
* 3.W A4 → symmetric;
* 3.W A1 → 4.B B1 captures W A1 and restores A1 to G.

The symmetric B2 try is an immediate snap-back: 1.W B2 puts C1–C2 in atari on B1 but W B2 itself has the single liberty B1, so 2.B B1 captures W B2 on the spot and connects C1–C2–B1. 1.W A3/A4 first moves are self-atari or are met by 2.B B2 which unites the three Black groups and leaves the attacking White stone with a single liberty on A4/A3 that Black can take and restore the complementary liberty.

Claims that 1.W A4, 1.W B1, 1.W B2 or 1.W A3 initiate a kill fail because any of those first moves ≠ D3 is met by 1…B D3 capturing D1–D2 at once, and after the forced 1.W D3 they are all met by the B2 connection and the snap-back/recapture pattern above. The earlier A4-capture argument ignores the forced D3 defence, and the B1/B2/A3 nets all require White to play into self-atari after 2.B B2.

Hence after the forced saving 1.W D3 Black always has a legal liberty-increasing or capturing reply – in particular the B2 connection – that keeps the merged A2–B3–B4–C1–C2 mass alive and removes or recaptures the attacking White stone. No first White point both preserves White’s own D1–D2–C3–C4 mass and forces Black into a position with no defence that keeps its groups alive. The initiating killing move set is empty.

